<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Deutsche Hypothekenbank</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.375     MATURITY    12.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HANNOVER  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 12.FEB.98 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
